    "summary": "Added resolveTaskScope in src/analyze/runtimes/shared/task-scope.ts: it resolves a plan task's scope for its family through resolveScopeForTarget, against the family's row of TARGET_TO_KINDS, and runs the indexed check for the code and docs families with the same readers. A refusal names the template. No task calls it yet. resolveScopeForTarget takes the table as an optional last parameter so that a test can show no other list is consulted. The catch-clause inventory of the runtime files gained the new file's one rethrow.",
